{VALUE}
The value to compare the returned results against. When comparing for equality using the EQ operator, the value must be an exact, case-sensitive match in order to be included in the response.

To filter by multiple values for a single attribute, supply the values as a comma-separated list:
GET {ENDPOINT}?filter[{ATTRIBUTE_NAME}]={OPERATOR} {VALUE_1},{VALUE_2}

To apply filters for multiple attributes, supply a parameter for each attribute. Parameters must be separated by ampersand (&) characters:
GET {ENDPOINT}?filter[{ATTRIBUTE_NAME_1}]={OPERATOR} {VALUE}&filter[{ATTRIBUTE_NAME_2}]={OPERATOR} {VALUE}

