In order to create access credentials for the API, an administrator within your organization must have previously set up product profiles for Privacy Service within Adobe Admin Console. The product profile that you assign to an API integration determines what permissions that integration has when accessing Privacy Service capabilities.

In order to make calls to the Privacy Service API, you must first gather your access credentials to be used in required headers:
